  "details": "I am of an American of Indian descent and I speak (though not fluently) a second language in addition to English.\n\nHowever, VRChat only lets me choose Hindi. I would like to represent knowing Punjabi, because I feel that's an important part of my ethnic identity and potentially a good icebreaker for a social platform like this.\n\nIt would also be nice to display the name of the language in English. \n\nInstead of \"हिन्दी\", it would be nice to have an option to show it as \"Hindi.\" This way, the majority of English speakers could recognize it on the profile.",
